OL,3,GNEWSAMayors will be free to use share
OL,4,Aof tax to give residents grants
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnglish regional mayors due to be
OL,7,Fhanded a share of tax revenues by
OL,8,Fcentral government will be free to use
OL,9,Fit to give cash grants to individual
OL,10,Fresidents and businesses, it has
OL,11,Femerged.
OL,13,FIn his Budget, Chancellor John Healey
OL,14,Funveiled plans to allow mayors to keep
OL,15,Fsome cash from income tax and business
OL,16,Frates collected locally, describing it
OL,17,Fas "the most radical act of devolution
OL,18,Fin a generation".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
