OL,3,GNEWSAMayors will be free to use share
OL,4,Aof tax to give residents grants
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham wants local
OL,7,Fleaders to be given more control over
OL,8,Fhow money is spent in their areas to
OL,9,Fboost economic growth and services.
OL,11,FBut Conservative Tees Valley Mayor Ben
OL,12,FHouchen says he has been given
OL,13,Fassurances that he will be able to give
OL,14,Fgrants to local residents instead.
